-- lib/mathtools.lekh: a small module (other files can `use` it)

share let pi be 3.14159

share to square n as number gives number:
    give back n * n

share to factorial n as number gives number:
    if n is at most 1: give back 1
    give back n * factorial of (n - 1)

share to average numbers as list of number gives maybe number:
    if length of numbers is 0: give back nothing
    give back some (sum of numbers) / length of numbers
